'''Bylam of Qym''' (Bylam Qodzar Lazmyq Miham ish Zhifol; DAY MONTH {{abbr|2408|2000 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}) is a member of the [[Qymish royal family]]. He is the infant son of [[Prince Qodzar of Qym|Prince Qodzar]] and [[Najat Miritani]]. 

